/Title (Another important aspect of preprocessing involved addressing language inconsistencies. The dataset contained a mixture of Russian and English text, particularly in the cruise names. To ensure uniformity and facilitate analysis, the cruise names were translated into English. This step improved the interpretability of the data and made it suitable for further text-based processing.)
